Package: JsBarcode
Title: Barcode Widgets for R using 'JsBarcode'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Enrique", "Pérez Herrero", email = "eph.project1500@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Johan", "Lindell", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Author of the bundled 'JsBarcode' JavaScript library")
  )
Description: An 'htmlwidgets' interface to the 'JsBarcode' JavaScript
    library. Generates 1D barcodes (CODE128, EAN-13, UPC, CODE39, ITF,
    MSI, Pharmacode, Codabar and more) as SVG for the 'RStudio' viewer,
    'R Markdown' / 'Quarto' documents and 'Shiny' applications.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://EnriquePH.github.io/JsBarcode/, https://github.com/EnriquePH/JsBarcode
BugReports: https://github.com/EnriquePH/JsBarcode/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    htmlwidgets,
    utils
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    shiny,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
